# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免跨平台 diff 噪声
* text=auto

# Windows 专用文件强制 CRLF 检出（cmd 对 LF 结尾的 .bat 兼容性不佳）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做任何转换
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary

# 语言统计：前端是单文件 HTML，别让 GitHub 把它当纯 HTML 计数
dist/index.html linguist-vendored=false
